        216.39,
        473.62,
        267.76,
        161.84,
        267.76
      ],
      "text": "Subject :- Indian Police Service-Promotion to Senior Scale,\nJunior Administrative Grade, Selection Grade,\nSuper Time Scale and above Super Time Scales -\nGuidelines regarding."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 5,
      "poly": [
        89.84,
        281.23,
        107.1,
        281.23,
        107.1,
        292.17,
        89.84,
        292.17
      ],
      "text": "Sir,"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 6,
      "poly": [
        88.66,
        305.65,
        539.66,
        305.65,
        539.66,
        491.73,
        88.66,
        491.73
      ],
      "text": "I am writing this to invite your attention is guidelines on the above subject\ncirculated vide this Ministry's letter No. 16011/39/89- IPS - II, dated 28.04.1988,\n16011/1/89- IPS - II, dated 04.09.1989 and 16011/61/90- IPS - II, dated 28.12.1990.\nTaking into consideration of certain difficulties brought to the notice of this Ministry\nfrom different quarters from time to time and the encaderment of post of Additional\nDirector General of Police in the police hierarchy, Government have decided to modify\nthe existing guidelines and have consolidate them in one place for the sake of\nreference. Further, in order to ensure uniformity of procedure in the matter of\npromotion, formation of DPC and their functioning etc., general principles of promotion\nare also being suggested for guidance."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 7,
      "poly": [
        87.46,
        499.31,
        539.07,
        499.31,
        539.07,
        569.19,
        87.46,
        569.19
      ],
      "text": "2. In order to ensure uniformity of procedure in the matter of appointment and\npromotion to various grades in the Indian Police Service in all the State Cadres in the\ncountry. It would be desirable to adhere to the revised guidelines and follow and\nimpose stricter standards of selection as envisages in the revised guidelines."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 8,
      "poly": [
        87.46,
        575.93,
        539.07,
        575.93,
        539.07,
        607.92,
        87.46,
        607.92
      ],
      "text": "3. A copy of the revised guidelines is sent herewith which may please be\nacknowledged."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 9,
      "poly": [
        366.52,
        614.66,
        447.44,
        614.66,
        447.44,
        628.13,
        366.52,
        628.13
      ],
      "text": "Yours faithfully,"
    },
